 against humanity Alan Garcia  ended his life in 2019 while he was  being detained following the operach  Scandal Alexandro todeo is wanted and is  an exile in the United States while he  faces an extradition request oleana  humala is being prosecuted much the same  story and now Castillo an addition with  corruption investigations also faces the  possible crime of rebellion that means  he could be facing many years in prison  in general it's a real disaster politics  and Peru is becoming more and more  unstable and radicalized and obviously  that has consequences it is obvious that  political stability affects investor  confidence it makes them hesitate if  there is no confidence or it's been  undermined then obviously the investment  rate is not going to progress Kurt  Bernier former Peruvian finance minister  at the moment growth expectations for  2023 are being reduced to around 2.5 and  ratings agencies such as Fitch have  recently revised the country's Outlook  from stable to negative the times when  Peru was the engine of Latin America and  a strong candidate for becoming a  regional Powerhouse seemed to be a thing  of the past I'll leave a link in the  description for a video in which scrape  in detail while Peru is getting worse  and worse but now it's over to you what  do you think will happen with the new  Peruvian government how do you rate  Castillo's time in office what do you  think needs to change in his country for  it to become the engine of Latin America  once more leave us your answers in the  comments below and if you've found this  video interesting don't forget to like  And subscribe to all of us here at  visualpolitik if you haven't already  done so all the best and I'll see you  next time  [Music]

